Third-party software
--------------------

This plugin bundles no third-party code. Every Maven dependency is declared
with `provided` scope and is supplied by the host application at runtime:

  - Atlassian jira-api 8.13.0 and sal-api 4.2.0 (Atlassian Pty Ltd)
  - osworkflow 2.9.0-atlassian-1
  - jsr311-api 1.1.1, javax.servlet-api 3.1.0, javax.inject 1

The UI is built on the Atlassian User Interface (AUI) and Velocity components
that Jira already serves; no JavaScript or CSS library is vendored into this
repository or into the built jar (verified: the jar contains only classes under
com/bskim/ plus this project's own templates, js/, css/ and images/).

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Atlassian.


